            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It is not possible to find the class centre for ",
                "marks": []
              },
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "60<a",
                "display": false
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ".",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "worked": "The class $60<a$ has no upper boundary, so its class centre cannot be found. The class-centre method therefore cannot estimate the mean without an assumption about this class. The printed table also omits all frequencies, which are needed to calculate $\\bar{x}=\\dfrac{\\sum(cc\\times f)}{\\sum f}$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
